#!/usr/bin/env python3
# D2c: march options and burner-body clearance (all default-off).
#   surface_patch.jet_decay_diameter = nozzle | momentum (+ jet_De_ref)
#   surface_patch.jet_free_surface = 0 | 1 (+ jet_fs_aspect, jet_fs_exponent)
#   surface_patch.jet_bin_update = explicit | exponential
#   surface_patch.jet_negative_flux = drop | count
#   surface_patch.foot_body_clearance = 0 | 1
#   studies/d2a2_walljet/walljet.h_expr(h_ref, far = clamp | power, n)
#
# Inputs:
#   ../robin_feet/input_feet     D2b quarter disk (24 x 24 x 40 at 2 mm), feet,
#                                exhaust recirculation, pinned, dt = 2 ms
#   ../jet_enthalpy/input_strip  320 x 1 x 4 strip, uniform 500 K IC, cell form,
#                                no losses, one logged step (profile interval 1 s)
#   ../jet_enthalpy/input_quarter, ../robin_jet/input_jet   (parse aborts)
# Runs (1 rank unless noted):
#   X0, X1   input_feet 5 s; X1 gives every new key at its default
#   M, MF    momentum (jet_De_ref = 1900 K value, core 8), 5 s; MF: fixed T_ent
#   MN, NF   fixed T_ent, 5 s: MN = momentum with jet_De_ref = jet_D, core 5;
#            NF = nozzle
#   FS, FS3  free surface, 10 s, profile every step; FS3 on 3 ranks
#   FSB      FS with the flame x20 on column (20, 0) (r = 41 mm, just outside
#            the ring): a constructed deep column beside the ring
#   FS0, FS0off  patch radius 40 mm (no column beyond foot_r_outer), fs on/off
#   QC       input_feet + negative_flux = count, 5 s
#   CLD, CLD3  input_feet + clearance, flame off on ring column (15, 0)
#            (r = 31 mm, it never fires and stands proud), 10 s; CLD3 on 3 ranks
#   SX1, SX4, SX025   strip, exponential, jet_dr = 1 m (one bin), 4, 0.25 mm
#   SE4, SE1, SE025   strip, explicit, jet_dr = 4, 1, 0.25 mm
#   NGx, NGe          strip, jet_T_nozzle = 400 K (below the 500 K rock),
#                     jet_stagnation = nozzle, count; explicit / exponential
#   HJ6, HJ12, HJ18, HJ30, HJ12c   strip, one bin, jet_stagnation = nozzle,
#            h = walljet.h_expr(1449, power, 1) at s = 6, 12, 18, 30 D;
#            HJ12c the clamp string at 12 D
#   A1-A16   parse aborts;  R1  runtime abort (free-surface column in bin 0)
#   KT, K15  (D2e) jet_T_ent_mode = rec_fixed, 5 s: KT with jet_T_rec_fixed =
#            jet_T_ent (293.15 K), K15 with 1550 K;  A17-A19 its parse aborts
# Checks:
#   (a) X1 == X0 (Level_0 Cell_D, removal_events.csv, whole thermo.dat text);
#       X0 has none of the D2c thermo columns.
#   (b) M: on every stepped row jet_D_e == jet_De_ref sqrt(jet_T_rec/T_ent) and
#       jet_T_stag == T_rec + (T_noz - T_rec) min(1, 8 jet_D_e/jet_s_c) (print
#       precision); MF: jet_D_e == jet_De_ref.
#   (c) MN == NF (Cell_D, removal_events, thermo text of the common columns).
#   (d) FS: invariants (print precision); jet_T_rec == the previous row's
#       jet_T_mouth (text); for every logged step the product of the per-bin
#       factors ((ib+1)/ib)^(e n_fs/n_cols) from jet_profile.csv equals the last
#       bin's m_ratio (1e-12) and the thermo jet_m_ratio of that step (print);
#       jet_T_mouth == the inlet T_gas of the first bin with n_fs > 0.
#       FS0 == FS0off (Cell_D, removal_events, common thermo), jet_fs_cols == 0.
#   (e) FS, FSB: jet_fs_cols == the hand classification on every stepped row
#       (tops rebuilt from removal_events.csv, s = nozzle_z - z_face > 0,
#       r > 40 mm and 0.080 - z_face <= 1.0 (r - 0.040)); the first row counts
#       every column beyond 40 mm; FSB's column (20, 0) drops out once it has
#       receded; FS3 == FS (removal_events, Cell_D, D2c thermo text).
#   (f) Strip, exponential: T_out (last profile row) == 500 + (T_in - 500)
#       exp(-G/(m cp)), G = sum h dA, to 1e-10 of the excess, at every jet_dr
#       (one bin included); single bin: P_bin == G (T_eff - 500) (1e-10).
#       Explicit: the error against the same exact value falls with jet_dr.
#   (g) NGx/NGe: jet_P_neg < 0, jet_P_face == jet_P_neg, T_gas rises bin to
#       bin, NGe's T_out == 500 - 100 exp(-G/(m cp)) (1e-10); QC: invariants
#       with the signed P_face on every row, P_face - P_neg >= 0. drop is the
#       default (a).
#   (h) CLD: regime-4 rows exist; each cut leaves the column at its pad height
#       (the pad rule applied by hand to the tops before the cut); applying the
#       cuts leaves every pad height unchanged (no ratchet); foot_z ==
#       the hand pad rule on every row; foot_mech_vol == sum n_voided dV of the
#       regime-4 rows and foot_mech_cols == their count per step; the ledger
#       closes (|ledger_err| <= 1e-10); CLD3 == CLD (events, Cell_D, thermo).
#   (i) Each abort returns rc != 0 with its message.
#   (k) D2e rec_fixed: KT == NF (fixed T_ent, entrained mass): Cell_D,
#       removal_events and the common thermo columns bit-identical, with
#       jet_T_rec == 293.15 and jet_P_recirc == 0 on every row. K15: the
#       invariants of (d) on every stepped row (P_face + P_exhaust == P_cap ==
#       mdot cp (T_noz - T_ent) + P_recirc, P_decay == 0), jet_T_rec == 1550
#       on every stepped row, and jet_P_recirc == (m - mdot) cp (1550 - T_ent)
#       with m cp = P_cap/(T_stag - T_ent), i.e. P_cap/(T_stag - T_ent) -
#       P_recirc/(1550 - T_ent) == mdot cp (print precision). A17-A19 abort.
#   (j) HJ: the parsed power h (P_bin = sum h (T_in - 500) dA of the one bin)
#       == walljet.h_py(..., power, 1) to 1e-12 at s = 6, 12, 18, 30 D;
#       HJ12 == HJ12c (continuity at 12 D, 1e-12); the power string is numeric
#       first; walljet.h_expr(1449) == the h_expr in
#       validation/meier/sp_meier_pilot/input_feet (default unchanged).
#
# Usage: test            (runs ALAMO, then checks)
#        test <outdir>   (checks existing outputs under <outdir>)

